1
00:01:33,031 --> 00:01:34,832
The Principality of Zeon

2
00:01:34,872 --> 00:01:38,312
A gigantic space
citystate floating beyond the moon

3
00:01:38,352 --> 00:01:40,913
Is dominated by
the Zabi royal family

4
00:01:40,953 --> 00:01:44,313
Who are determined to control all of humanity

5
00:01:49,398 --> 00:01:50,398
Girenz Abi

6
00:01:50,438 --> 00:01:51,917
leader of
the Abi family

7
00:01:51,957 --> 00:01:53,957
began his battle
with the Earth Federation

8
00:01:53,997 --> 00:01:57,797
in order to force all of mankind to kneel before him

9
00:01:58,797 --> 00:01:59,717
The White Base

10
00:01:59,757 --> 00:02:02,276
which had managed to survive the Zeon attack

11
00:02:02,316 --> 00:02:06,036
escaped from the
space colony side seven and descended to Earth

12
00:02:06,076 --> 00:02:11,195
The young crew however have been forced to continue fighting one battle after another

13
00:02:11,235 --> 00:02:12,115
And for Amuro

14
00:02:12,155 --> 00:02:16,315
saying goodbye to his long lost mother was an even heavier burden

15
00:02:25,859 --> 00:02:28,059
Time be still

16
00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:31,781
I call this trick
victory to the principality

17
00:02:31,821 --> 00:02:34,461
Get him
out of here

18
00:02:40,838 --> 00:02:41,559
Get out

19
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:43,681
I don't need that
stupid bird around my zaku

20
00:02:43,721 --> 00:02:44,521
I need ammo

21
00:02:44,561 --> 00:02:45,122
Hey，Yell

22
00:02:45,162 --> 00:02:46,844
yelling at the
pigeons won't get you far

23
00:02:46,884 --> 00:02:47,524
leave it alone

24
00:02:47,564 --> 00:02:48,765
This close to
the battlefront

25
00:02:48,805 --> 00:02:51,607
and all I do is
scrape bird droppings off my zaku

26
00:02:51,808 --> 00:02:53,570
Hey，come on
down now，Yell

27
00:02:53,610 --> 00:02:54,651
we gotta talk

28
00:02:54,691 --> 00:02:55,731
Alright

29
00:02:58,134 --> 00:02:58,894
What is it？

30
00:02:58,934 --> 00:03:00,615
Isn't the wreck
crew out here？

31
00:03:00,936 --> 00:03:01,217
Yeah

32
00:03:01,257 --> 00:03:03,938
it's gotta be
boring without any girls

33
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:05,820
You mean

34
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:08,342
the Federation's
mobile suit is out here？

35
00:03:08,382 --> 00:03:09,022
You know Saul

36
00:03:09,062 --> 00:03:10,223
the com guy，right？

37
00:03:10,263 --> 00:03:11,664
He gets reports
through command

38
00:03:11,704 --> 00:03:12,904
and I heard
it from him

39
00:03:12,944 --> 00:03:15,626
Then does that
mean our unit is heading out pretty soon？

40
00:03:15,666 --> 00:03:17,227
Dole，we're
just a patrol unit

41
00:03:17,267 --> 00:03:19,989
So the last thing
they're gonna do is send us out to fight

42
00:03:20,029 --> 00:03:21,710
Plus we got a
pretty nervous CO

43
00:03:21,750 --> 00:03:24,231
and he's not
gonna want to start something

44
00:03:24,271 --> 00:03:25,231
And so…

45
00:03:25,271 --> 00:03:27,630
We've been thinking of hitting that Federation mobile suit

46
00:03:27,670 --> 00:03:30,070
with just the
younger guys in our patrol

47
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:31,910
You really want
to hit that mobile suit？

48
00:03:31,950 --> 00:03:33,949
And how many of
these things do we have to deal with？

49
00:03:33,989 --> 00:03:34,669
Well，Yal

50
00:03:34,709 --> 00:03:36,269
the commander
says it's okay for us

51
00:03:36,309 --> 00:03:37,629
to take out the
enemy on our own

52
00:03:37,669 --> 00:03:39,629
as long as we don'
t get them into any trouble

53
00:03:39,669 --> 00:03:40,428
If all goes well

54
00:03:40,468 --> 00:03:42,508
then they'll have
no choice but to send us home

55
00:03:42,548 --> 00:03:43,668
Back to
civilization

56
00:03:43,708 --> 00:03:44,708
where we'll
kick up our feet

57
00:03:44,748 --> 00:03:45,828
and enjoy nice
clean

58
00:03:45,868 --> 00:03:46,747
bugfree Zion

59
00:03:46,787 --> 00:03:47,947
Yeah，but
what about…

60
00:03:47,987 --> 00:03:50,667
There's only my
one Zaku in this entire unit

61
00:03:50,707 --> 00:03:52,147
so what about
you guys，huh？

62
00:03:52,187 --> 00:03:52,787
Hey，Saul

63
00:03:52,827 --> 00:03:53,669
tell 'em the plan

64
00:03:53,709 --> 00:03:54,709
okay？

65
00:03:54,950 --> 00:03:55,591
So far

66
00:03:55,631 --> 00:03:58,074
our adversary has
depended on one mobile suit

67
00:03:58,114 --> 00:04:00,556
And it's not much
better than a prototype

68
00:04:20,907 --> 00:04:23,588
The engine repair
will be completed by the crack of dawn

69
00:04:23,628 --> 00:04:25,630
There's nothing
to worry about，Now

70
00:04:25,670 --> 00:04:27,351
you were wanting
to ask me about something？

71
00:04:27,391 --> 00:04:29,473
You're well aware
that we're not regular soldiers

72
00:04:29,513 --> 00:04:31,434
So why are you
bothering to resupply us

73
00:04:31,474 --> 00:04:33,515
And do all these
extensive repairs on White Base

74
00:04:33,555 --> 00:04:34,076
Lieutenant？

75
00:04:34,116 --> 00:04:36,357
The Federation
doesn't want to abandon the White Base

76
00:04:36,397 --> 00:04:37,758
After everything
they've invested

77
00:04:37,798 --> 00:04:39,680
And they do intend to send out a ranking officer

78
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,480
Who'll act as
your superior

79
00:04:41,962 --> 00:04:42,644
However

80
00:04:42,684 --> 00:04:44,771
there's a big
offensive being planned in Europe

81
00:04:44,811 --> 00:04:46,777
Your small crew
has been winning tough battles

82
00:04:46,817 --> 00:04:48,101
With no
commander this far

83
00:04:48,141 --> 00:04:50,228
And I'm afraid
the Federation simply does not have

84
00:04:50,268 --> 00:04:52,633
any officers
available for you right now

85
00:04:53,115 --> 00:04:54,115
Lieutenant Matilda

86
00:04:54,155 --> 00:04:55,196
is it
really that bad？

87
00:04:55,236 --> 00:04:56,996
The Xeons are in
the same situation

88
00:04:57,036 --> 00:05:00,556
And now that the White Base's primary mission is turning out to be data collection

89
00:05:00,596 --> 00:05:02,436
You'll just have
to do the best you can

90
00:05:02,476 --> 00:05:03,677
Data collection？

91
00:05:03,717 --> 00:05:04,397
Right

92
00:05:04,437 --> 00:05:08,717
we've discovered that amateurs tend to devise more interesting strategies than professionals

93
00:05:08,757 --> 00:05:12,278
We can pick up any information on your battles from the memory on your computer

94
00:05:12,318 --> 00:05:12,998
So

95
00:05:13,038 --> 00:05:16,998
what you're saying is you ignore us on purpose so that we can be guinea pigs？

96
00:05:17,038 --> 00:05:18,838
You don't like
being a guinea pig

97
00:05:18,878 --> 00:05:20,399
do you
Ensign Bright？

98
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:22,880
Well，I haven't
received such orders

99
00:05:23,081 --> 00:05:23,801
Me？

100
00:05:23,962 --> 00:05:25,042
Ensign？

101
00:05:25,163 --> 00:05:26,604
Yes，well，anyway

102
00:05:26,644 --> 00:05:28,646
that's what
General Revel said

103
00:05:28,726 --> 00:05:30,928
They'll notify
you of your new rank soon enough

104
00:05:30,968 --> 00:05:32,290
They sure like
to jerk us around

105
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:34,732
If it wasn't for
General Revel intervening on your behalf

106
00:05:34,772 --> 00:05:36,974
you would've been
courtmartialed long ago

107
00:05:37,855 --> 00:05:38,656
Courtmartialed？

108
00:05:38,696 --> 00:05:39,496
Yes

109
00:05:40,297 --> 00:05:41,698
What is it，Amuro？

110
00:05:44,799 --> 00:05:45,760
It's your
time to sleep

111
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,442
so why don't you
keep your schedule？

112
00:05:47,482 --> 00:05:48,363
Sir

113
00:05:48,483 --> 00:05:49,524
Soldier？

114
00:05:52,248 --> 00:05:54,291
It's like Mr
Bride has told you

115
00:05:54,331 --> 00:05:57,293
Sleep is an
important part of a pilot's job too

116
00:05:57,615 --> 00:05:58,855
Yes，ma'am

117
00:05:59,817 --> 00:06:01,499
I'll keep
that in mind

118
00:06:02,811 --> 00:06:04,212
I don't
believe him

119
00:06:04,252 --> 00:06:08,215
Is it really so criminal to have taken control of White Base and Gundam Lieutenant？

120
00:06:08,255 --> 00:06:08,856
Well，is it？

121
00:06:08,896 --> 00:06:10,777
Until
just recently

122
00:06:11,258 --> 00:06:12,179
My good ensign

123
00:06:12,219 --> 00:06:13,540
Bright Noah

124
00:06:18,304 --> 00:06:19,305
So，where
did you go

125
00:06:19,345 --> 00:06:20,346
Amuro？

126
00:06:20,987 --> 00:06:22,267
The restroom

127
00:06:22,468 --> 00:06:23,909
It's that way

128
00:06:25,911 --> 00:06:26,632
Yeah，well

129
00:06:26,672 --> 00:06:27,952
whatever，Frau

130
00:06:30,829 --> 00:06:31,870
What is it？

131
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:33,030
Nothing

132
00:06:33,151 --> 00:06:34,792
nothing，Amuro

133
00:06:34,832 --> 00:06:36,392
Let's go，Haro

134
00:06:37,593 --> 00:06:38,994
What was that？

135
00:07:12,297 --> 00:07:13,938
Hey，have you
had your meal yet

136
00:07:13,978 --> 00:07:14,898
Amuro？

137
00:07:17,138 --> 00:07:17,779
Amuro

138
00:07:17,819 --> 00:07:19,579
have you had
your meal yet？

139
00:07:20,139 --> 00:07:21,419
No，no，not yet

140
00:07:21,459 --> 00:07:23,180
We're going to
breach the ZM patrols

141
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:25,980
So I want you to
have Gundam ready on standby

142
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:27,100
all right？

143
00:07:27,261 --> 00:07:28,741
Yes，sir

144
00:07:39,053 --> 00:07:39,693
Sir

145
00:07:39,733 --> 00:07:41,655
this is Lieutenant Matilda's flight path

146
00:07:41,695 --> 00:07:43,097
And this one
here is ours

147
00:07:43,137 --> 00:07:43,978
Mr， Bright

148
00:07:44,018 --> 00:07:45,299
Both routes
are clear，Sir

149
00:07:45,339 --> 00:07:47,861
Do you think we have any chance of making it through successfully？

150
00:07:47,901 --> 00:07:49,863
I suppose it's
up to the Zeon

151
00:07:53,387 --> 00:07:54,548
I'm sure I saw it

152
00:07:54,588 --> 00:07:56,110
Something shining
on the port side

153
00:07:56,150 --> 00:07:59,032
The Manovski particles are too dense for us to identify the object

154
00:07:59,072 --> 00:08:00,594
So we've no
choice but to send out a flare

155
00:08:00,634 --> 00:08:01,114
Lieutenant

156
00:08:01,154 --> 00:08:02,796
There's no
patrol scheduled here

157
00:08:02,836 --> 00:08:04,197
so be careful

158
00:08:05,289 --> 00:08:07,090
No response
to the flare

159
00:08:07,851 --> 00:08:08,612
Descend

160
00:08:08,652 --> 00:08:10,493
we'll escape
using full combat speed

161
00:08:10,533 --> 00:08:12,494
Prepare
antiaircraft guns

162
00:08:19,490 --> 00:08:20,809
It's a
medea transport

163
00:08:20,849 --> 00:08:23,089
travelling at
full combat speed

164
00:08:23,329 --> 00:08:25,768
It doesn't seem
to be carrying a load

165
00:08:25,808 --> 00:08:28,248
I bet they must
have unloaded near here

166
00:08:28,408 --> 00:08:29,128
Yeah

167
00:08:29,168 --> 00:08:30,688
maybe it resupplied the Trojan horse

168
00:08:30,728 --> 00:08:32,447
That Chief Korn
was talking about

169
00:08:32,487 --> 00:08:33,607
It's possible

170
00:08:33,647 --> 00:08:34,967
Send out a flare

171
00:08:35,007 --> 00:08:35,887
Right

172
00:08:42,887 --> 00:08:44,448
Quick，get
the zaku ready

173
00:08:44,488 --> 00:08:45,249
Right，Hey

174
00:08:45,289 --> 00:08:47,330
tell the commander we're moving out immediately

175
00:08:47,370 --> 00:08:47,931
My life

176
00:08:47,971 --> 00:08:49,372
When I attack
them with the zaku

177
00:08:49,412 --> 00:08:52,094
They'll automatically retaliate with their mobile suit

178
00:08:52,134 --> 00:08:53,816
Tell Chief
Quarren to be ready to jump in

179
00:08:53,856 --> 00:08:55,056
Right，Sergeant

180
00:09:03,856 --> 00:09:04,456
Hey，wait up

181
00:09:04,496 --> 00:09:05,737
Chief Quarren

182
00:09:07,018 --> 00:09:08,578
Saul，hurry up

183
00:09:08,618 --> 00:09:10,139
When the mobile
suit comes out

184
00:09:10,179 --> 00:09:12,621
we'll follow the
plan we discussed yesterday

185
00:09:12,661 --> 00:09:15,542
Don't forget that
we all go home if this works out

186
00:09:15,582 --> 00:09:16,502
Saul

187
00:09:16,543 --> 00:09:17,143
you ready？

188
00:09:17,183 --> 00:09:17,983
Sir

189
00:09:26,817 --> 00:09:28,898
Why are they
up so early？

190
00:09:28,938 --> 00:09:31,418
That's
quarren for you

191
00:09:37,099 --> 00:09:37,779
I see it

192
00:09:37,819 --> 00:09:39,659
there's the
Medea transport

193
00:09:43,569 --> 00:09:45,650
Return fire at
one o'clock now

194
00:09:45,690 --> 00:09:47,170
Make a
hard descent

195
00:09:47,490 --> 00:09:49,531
I'll bet that
fire is coming from Izuku

196
00:09:49,571 --> 00:09:51,331
Skim right
over the enemy

197
00:09:52,692 --> 00:09:55,773
That's pretty
fast for such a big transport vehicle

198
00:09:57,414 --> 00:09:58,854
Hey，where is it？

199
00:09:58,894 --> 00:10:00,895
I wish I had
lagoon support right now

200
00:10:00,935 --> 00:10:05,977
What？

201
00:10:06,017 --> 00:10:07,577
The container
's been hit

202
00:10:07,617 --> 00:10:08,618
Doesn't matter

203
00:10:08,658 --> 00:10:09,898
keep going

204
00:10:19,396 --> 00:10:20,636
Laser analysis

205
00:10:20,676 --> 00:10:22,477
Lemedia is
in combat

206
00:10:22,637 --> 00:10:23,997
Matilda's
in trouble

207
00:10:24,037 --> 00:10:24,957
Attention all crew

208
00:10:24,997 --> 00:10:27,038
The Lemedia has
been snared by enemy patrol

209
00:10:27,078 --> 00:10:29,119
White base will
provide support

210
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:30,319
Mr， Bright，it's me

211
00:10:30,359 --> 00:10:31,639
Why don't we
launch Gundam？

212
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:32,559
Let's do
that instead

213
00:10:32,599 --> 00:10:34,880
because White
base isn't prepped with supplies

214
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,720
Yes

215
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,801
but are you
up for it？

216
00:10:36,841 --> 00:10:38,241
Are you sure？

217
00:10:38,361 --> 00:10:38,881
Sir

218
00:10:38,921 --> 00:10:40,481
I'm ready
to launch

219
00:10:48,661 --> 00:10:49,862
Is that it？

220
00:10:51,503 --> 00:10:54,465
I hope nothing
bad has happened to Miss Matilda

221
00:11:03,553 --> 00:11:04,233
Oh no

222
00:11:04,273 --> 00:11:06,554
it's the Federation's new mobile suit

223
00:11:08,171 --> 00:11:09,734
Gundam， look，Yes

224
00:11:09,774 --> 00:11:12,139
but he didn't
have to bother trying to help us

225
00:11:12,179 --> 00:11:14,904
Let's escape from
here so this wasn't all a waste of his time

226
00:11:14,944 --> 00:11:15,825
Right

227
00:11:18,231 --> 00:11:19,072
Good luck to you

228
00:11:19,112 --> 00:11:20,154
Miss Matilda

229
00:11:20,194 --> 00:11:21,998
Please don't get
too out of hand

230
00:11:22,038 --> 00:11:23,079
Amuro

231
00:11:35,365 --> 00:11:36,807
Did I get him？

232
00:11:44,384 --> 00:11:46,147
Hey，what's
that noise？

233
00:11:58,923 --> 00:12:00,124
That's it？

234
00:12:00,484 --> 00:12:03,605
How are they gonna attack Gundam with just machine guns？

235
00:12:07,766 --> 00:12:09,046
There's
nothing wrong at all

236
00:12:09,086 --> 00:12:10,967
why am I
shaking so bad？

237
00:12:11,647 --> 00:12:13,648
Hey，you're
not getting away

238
00:12:27,741 --> 00:12:28,661
Show

239
00:12:29,381 --> 00:12:31,381
You shouldn't
have come out

240
00:12:35,181 --> 00:12:36,900
Hide under
the trees now

241
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:38,820
don't get
hit from a bomb

242
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:43,700
Where are they？

243
00:13:14,238 --> 00:13:14,918
我會捉到你，我會

244
00:13:37,941 --> 00:13:40,424
阿姆羅，答我，阿姆羅，你哋毀咗扎古？

245
00:13:40,464 --> 00:13:41,465
阿姆羅，你答我啦

246
00:14:01,127 --> 00:14:02,530
The enemy
ships arrived

247
00:14:02,570 --> 00:14:05,015
Fall back and
shoot at the bombs on the mobile suit

248
00:14:05,055 --> 00:14:05,776
Go

249
00:14:09,024 --> 00:14:10,467
Lousy pilot

250
00:14:10,507 --> 00:14:11,268
Listen

251
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:13,232
All we have to do
is hit one of those bombs

252
00:14:13,272 --> 00:14:15,756
And that mobile
suit is gone forever

253
00:14:19,266 --> 00:14:20,627
You don't
know who I am

254
00:14:20,667 --> 00:14:21,948
You think I'
m a weakling？

255
00:14:21,988 --> 00:14:23,868
I'll show
you my power

256
00:14:27,430 --> 00:14:29,031
My shield has
just been…it's…

257
00:14:29,071 --> 00:14:30,711
it's been
blown apart

258
00:14:32,032 --> 00:14:33,153
Yes，I see now

259
00:14:33,193 --> 00:14:35,873
They've flown
around gunning and planted bombs on me

260
00:14:35,914 --> 00:14:37,154
They're gonna…

261
00:14:49,829 --> 00:14:50,390
No

262
00:14:50,430 --> 00:14:51,831
there's one here

263
00:14:53,677 --> 00:14:54,158
What？

264
00:14:54,198 --> 00:14:57,044
How many of these
bombs did they plant on my mobile suit？

265
00:14:57,084 --> 00:14:58,046
What's going on？

266
00:14:58,086 --> 00:14:58,727
Amuro

267
00:14:58,767 --> 00:15:00,411
They've planted
bombs all over Gundam

268
00:15:00,451 --> 00:15:01,293
Bright

269
00:15:01,333 --> 00:15:02,535
This isn't
a good spot

270
00:15:02,575 --> 00:15:04,859
I'll move to the
clearing up ahead and check

271
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:06,861
Right，Roger that

272
00:15:06,901 --> 00:15:08,181
get Omer
down there now

273
00:15:08,221 --> 00:15:09,141
He's the
bomb expert

274
00:15:09,181 --> 00:15:11,301
and he'll be able
to give us a hand here

275
00:15:11,901 --> 00:15:15,301
So we have to sit
here and wait 30 minutes for our bombs to go off？

276
00:15:15,341 --> 00:15:16,622
Just be patient

277
00:15:16,662 --> 00:15:20,222
Never thought it'
d be so easy to plant bombs on that mobile suit

278
00:15:20,262 --> 00:15:23,182
Wonder if their
crew can save the mobile suit in time

279
00:15:23,623 --> 00:15:26,706
It'd be much better if it could be done by remote control

280
00:15:26,746 --> 00:15:28,748
It'd definitely be kaboom

281
00:15:28,788 --> 00:15:29,389
You bet

282
00:15:29,429 --> 00:15:30,991
A regular
patrol unit like ours

283
00:15:31,031 --> 00:15:32,793
doesn't get
supplied with stuff like that

284
00:15:32,833 --> 00:15:35,476
Wonder if their experts can remove the bombs in under 30 minutes

285
00:15:35,516 --> 00:15:36,877
There's five left
right？

286
00:15:36,917 --> 00:15:37,838
We had six bombs

287
00:15:37,878 --> 00:15:39,841
but there's one
that blew up the shield

288
00:15:39,881 --> 00:15:41,322
I can't wait

289
00:15:55,705 --> 00:15:57,788
I'm not really
sure what to do

290
00:15:57,828 --> 00:16:01,912
But all I can tell you is that it's set to detonate in a very short period of time

291
00:16:02,313 --> 00:16:02,874
Almero

292
00:16:02,914 --> 00:16:06,198
can you tell us anything from the Xrays that might be of any use to us？

293
00:16:06,238 --> 00:16:06,878
Well

294
00:16:06,918 --> 00:16:08,841
it doesn't
really tell me a lot

295
00:16:08,881 --> 00:16:11,203
This thin wire
here should work like a time fuse

296
00:16:11,243 --> 00:16:12,684
and that'
s about it

297
00:16:13,526 --> 00:16:16,209
If we tear off
the plastic explosive from the magnet

298
00:16:16,249 --> 00:16:17,651
we'll set it off

299
00:16:17,691 --> 00:16:18,811
Right，Omer？

300
00:16:18,892 --> 00:16:20,533
Yeah，that's right

301
00:16:21,375 --> 00:16:23,539
We've got no
choice but to take them off by hand

302
00:16:23,579 --> 00:16:24,181
Alright then

303
00:16:24,221 --> 00:16:25,583
I'm doing it，go

304
00:16:25,623 --> 00:16:27,506
But this is my
responsibility

305
00:16:27,546 --> 00:16:29,389
Please
let me do it

306
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:30,913
There's very
little time

307
00:16:30,953 --> 00:16:32,475
so please
head for safety

308
00:16:32,515 --> 00:16:33,837
I'll get on it

309
00:16:34,038 --> 00:16:36,762
It looks like the
pilots removing the bombs

310
00:16:38,674 --> 00:16:39,916
If they
have any sense

311
00:16:39,956 --> 00:16:43,763
they should know those bombs are automatically set to explode in a short while

312
00:16:43,803 --> 00:16:45,806
That pilot's
removing them？

313
00:16:48,572 --> 00:16:50,776
There's 12
minutes left until it's all over

314
00:16:50,816 --> 00:16:53,099
Is he really
serious about this？

315
00:17:14,497 --> 00:17:15,257
It's incredible

316
00:17:15,297 --> 00:17:16,898
but he's removed
two bombs already

317
00:17:16,938 --> 00:17:17,939
He's got guts

318
00:17:17,979 --> 00:17:20,020
or maybe he'
s just crazy

319
00:17:21,782 --> 00:17:23,984
Is he on the
third one already？Well

320
00:17:24,024 --> 00:17:25,385
it looks like they
've got the crane up

321
00:17:25,425 --> 00:17:29,227
Eight minutes left

322
00:17:29,307 --> 00:17:30,908
Will he make it？

323
00:17:37,146 --> 00:17:40,110
Why are we just standing around watching instead of helping him out？

324
00:17:40,150 --> 00:17:40,991
If we all pitch in

325
00:17:41,031 --> 00:17:42,433
it'll get
done much quicker

326
00:17:42,473 --> 00:17:44,156
They all might
explode any second now

327
00:17:44,196 --> 00:17:47,240
We don't want to
sacrifice any more than absolutely necessary

328
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:49,923
And Amuro's the
one who's volunteered to do it

329
00:17:50,084 --> 00:17:51,647
What are you？
Please，no，Bravo

330
00:17:51,687 --> 00:17:53,129
Let go，Mira

331
00:17:53,169 --> 00:17:54,972
you're a coward
just like the rest of them

332
00:17:55,012 --> 00:17:56,653
You're all cowards

333
00:17:56,894 --> 00:17:57,854
Say what you want

334
00:17:57,894 --> 00:17:58,454
Frau Bo

335
00:17:58,494 --> 00:18:01,134
Restraining
yourself is also a sign of bravery

336
00:18:01,174 --> 00:18:04,615
We just can't allow you to sacrifice yourself along with Amuro

337
00:18:04,655 --> 00:18:06,215
You've got
it all wrong

338
00:18:06,255 --> 00:18:07,135
Why Amuro？

339
00:18:07,175 --> 00:18:08,255
He's a pilot

340
00:18:08,295 --> 00:18:10,535
Why can't I
do it instead？

341
00:18:10,895 --> 00:18:12,375
That's not
the point， Frau

342
00:18:12,415 --> 00:18:15,615
You'll never be
able to handle those bombs better than Amuro

343
00:18:16,415 --> 00:18:18,775
But Mira，You're…

344
00:18:18,815 --> 00:18:20,295
You're horrible

345
00:18:23,228 --> 00:18:36,715
Won't he give up？
If these explode now

346
00:18:36,755 --> 00:18:38,516
that's it
for Gundam

347
00:18:38,556 --> 00:18:39,596
and me

348
00:18:43,738 --> 00:18:45,418
He's got another
one or two yet？

349
00:18:45,458 --> 00:18:46,779
Yeah，I think so

350
00:18:46,819 --> 00:18:48,019
He sure is
persistent

351
00:18:48,059 --> 00:18:49,940
What kind of
soldier would be this crazy？

352
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:50,981
They're on a timer

353
00:18:51,021 --> 00:18:52,781
and we gotta
assume he knows that

354
00:18:52,821 --> 00:18:54,862
So he must be
pretty brave to keep at it

355
00:18:54,902 --> 00:18:57,023
Knowing they
could explode at any second

356
00:18:57,063 --> 00:18:59,224
But let's recruit
him for our side

357
00:19:12,926 --> 00:19:14,647
It's taking
a lot of time

358
00:19:14,687 --> 00:19:15,488
Where'd he go？

359
00:19:15,528 --> 00:19:16,568
Let's see

360
00:19:16,729 --> 00:19:18,770
It looks like he
went around back

361
00:19:18,810 --> 00:19:19,611
Yeah

362
00:19:19,651 --> 00:19:21,652
he's running
out of time now

363
00:19:35,797 --> 00:19:38,476
阿爾，它太遲了

364
00:19:38,596 --> 00:19:39,716
阿爾…

365
00:19:42,076 --> 00:19:43,316
阿爾，不

366
00:19:43,356 --> 00:19:45,036
好嘅，所有嘅嘢都係要將
Gundam嘅手臂同腿抬高啲，接管橋樑

367
00:19:45,076 --> 00:19:45,716
不，我哋要你哋停手

368
00:19:45,756 --> 00:19:46,716
繼續待喺白色基地

369
00:20:12,684 --> 00:20:13,284
Wait

370
00:20:13,324 --> 00:20:14,724
that
should be good

371
00:20:19,124 --> 00:20:20,964
One minute and
twenty seconds

372
00:20:21,004 --> 00:20:22,884
I don't think
you can do it

373
00:20:26,363 --> 00:20:27,323
Amrou，hurry

374
00:20:27,363 --> 00:20:28,963
it's taking too long

375
00:20:30,283 --> 00:20:31,323
Okay

376
00:20:32,163 --> 00:20:33,323
Go for it，Kai

377
00:20:33,363 --> 00:20:34,682
Alright，guys

378
00:20:34,722 --> 00:20:36,762
I'm driving
one kilometer

379
00:20:43,639 --> 00:20:44,279
Look

380
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:45,838
they removed them all

381
00:20:46,357 --> 00:20:48,595
Just 18
seconds left

382
00:21:34,665 --> 00:21:37,306
So much for going
back home to Zeon

383
00:21:37,546 --> 00:21:41,788
I suppose we're not the only ones willing to risk our lives in this miserable war

384
00:21:43,629 --> 00:21:44,349
Hey

385
00:21:44,389 --> 00:21:45,510
what do you
think he's like？

386
00:21:45,550 --> 00:21:48,151
That fool who
removed all those bombs？

387
00:21:52,581 --> 00:21:54,745
Got any more？
Sure you bet

388
00:21:56,150 --> 00:21:57,674
There's a
car coming

389
00:21:57,714 --> 00:22:00,521
What？ Looks like
a civilian truck over there

390
00:22:00,561 --> 00:22:01,924
It's a
station wagon

391
00:22:01,964 --> 00:22:02,926
That's strange

392
00:22:02,966 --> 00:22:03,889
in this
remote place

393
00:22:03,929 --> 00:22:05,330
what are
they doing？

394
00:22:18,095 --> 00:22:20,016
Hey，check this out

395
00:22:20,056 --> 00:22:21,737
A Zeon
mobile suit？

396
00:22:21,777 --> 00:22:23,058
I don't think so

397
00:22:23,098 --> 00:22:24,299
Who are you men？

398
00:22:24,339 --> 00:22:26,020
And what are you
doing way out here？

399
00:22:26,060 --> 00:22:26,260
Well

400
00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:28,541
we're just a bunch of guys who are from around this area

401
00:22:28,581 --> 00:22:28,741
Now

402
00:22:28,781 --> 00:22:30,903
that wouldn't be
a Federation mobile suit

403
00:22:30,943 --> 00:22:31,823
would it？Hey

404
00:22:31,863 --> 00:22:33,624
is the guy who's
wearing the cool white uniform there

405
00:22:33,664 --> 00:22:36,226
the pilot of that
colossal looking mobile suit？

406
00:22:36,386 --> 00:22:37,507
What's wrong？

407
00:22:37,547 --> 00:22:38,547
Did you
hurt yourself

408
00:22:38,587 --> 00:22:39,828
Mr， Pilot？

409
00:22:39,868 --> 00:22:40,949
Don't look
so serious

410
00:22:40,989 --> 00:22:42,269
Mr， Pilot

411
00:22:42,630 --> 00:22:44,510
Keep up the fight
and make us all proud

412
00:22:44,550 --> 00:22:45,511
soldier boy

413
00:22:45,551 --> 00:22:47,071
Good luck，kid

414
00:22:48,952 --> 00:22:50,272
Lucky guys

415
00:22:50,312 --> 00:22:52,433
I envy people who
get to live on Earth

416
00:22:52,473 --> 00:22:54,234
They're
so carefree

417
00:22:56,835 --> 00:22:57,715
They planted the bombs

418
00:22:57,755 --> 00:22:59,155
Mira，those
were the soldiers

419
00:22:59,195 --> 00:23:00,916
Sure seems
that way to me

420
00:23:18,328 --> 00:23:21,009
The Gallop and
Goof appear in the desert

421
00:23:21,049 --> 00:23:23,490
Sailor is desperate to know the fate of Shara

422
00:23:23,530 --> 00:23:26,491
and launches into
battle against Bright's orders

423
00:23:26,571 --> 00:23:29,013
Her reckless
actions put the White Base in danger

424
00:23:29,053 --> 00:23:31,453
as Amuro
attempts a rescue

425
00:23:33,295 --> 00:23:34,855
Mobile Suit Gundam

426
00:23:34,895 --> 00:23:40,178
Next episode：
Sailor's Agony

427
00:23:41,298 --> 00:23:43,139
Who will survive？

428
00:23:51,548 --> 00:23:52,509
阿姆羅，振り向かないで

429
00:23:52,549 --> 00:23:54,591
宇宙の彼方に輝く星は

430
00:23:55,232 --> 00:23:57,474
阿姆羅，お前の生まれたふるさとだ

